						This is the personal website of <span class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-fg-dark">Simon Gardier</span>.<span class="inline-block w-[7px] h-[1em] align-middle bg-neutral-400 dark:bg-neutral-300 ml-1 animate-smooth-blink"></span>
					</p>
					<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3.5">
						<a
							href="/files/Simon_Gardier_Acad.pdf"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="btn gap-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono"
						>
							<span class="i-lucide:rss text-xs text-sky-500"></span>
							<span>Resume</span>
						</a>
						<a
							href="mailto:gardiersimon.dev@gmail.com"
							class="btn gap-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono"
						>
							<span class="i-ion:mail-outline text-xs text-sky-500"></span>
							<span>Email</span>
						</a>
						<a
							href="https://github.com/simon-gardier/"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="btn gap-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono"
						>
							<span class="i-eva:github-outline text-xs"></span>
							<span>GitHub</span>
						</a>
						<a
							href="https://scholar.google.com.ni/citations?hl=en&user=OuG3N-EAAAAJ"
							target="_blank"
							rel="noopener noreferrer"
							class="btn gap-2 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-xs font-mono"
